From: MasherDon <62326358+MasherDon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:03:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 78/91] moe-stream : presets
 (LLAMA_MOE_STREAM_PRESET=exact|default|fast - fill unset keys: exact
 DROP_W=0, fast C14=0.2), the adaptive D14 drive switch
 (LLAMA_MOE_STREAM_MIRROR_ADAPT=S, off by default: a primary read of 16 ms or
 more sends reads to the copy from 2 in flight for S s), the oracle's
 ORACLE_ONLY filter by trace mark and the trace mark x for dropped experts
 (SiegeLadder eighteenth session)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
